Um, a card comes with it! The PR card 'Tokoyami Towa' usable in the Hololive Official Card Game. Note that the card is only available to those who purchase from the Hololive Production Official Shop. The bonus includes a key card to show off your oshi and an oshi holomem card. Please check the website for details on the cards and how to play!

314
00:49:00,672 --> 00:49:13,072
ということで以上、常闇トワ誕生日記念グッズの情報でした！みんな買ってね！これですてきなMV作るんだから買ってくれないといいの作れないから（笑）よろしくね！（笑）
And that wraps up the info on Tokoyami Towa's birthday commemoration goods! Everyone, please buy them! We're making a wonderful MV with this, so if you don't buy it, we can't make a good one! Haha. Please do!

